    <briefdescription>
<para>Per-source-variable image record: a factored representation of the target-ring element that variable maps to. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The image is <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_ring_map_1_1var_ae5f4f5e9b0138ee49bd3ea321ebd83a1_1ae5f4f5e9b0138ee49bd3ea321ebd83a1" kindref="member">coeff</ref> * <ref refid="struct_ring_map_1_1var_ab5ebc70aae92ce7df61aac25ebd0ab83_1ab5ebc70aae92ce7df61aac25ebd0ab83" kindref="member">monom</ref> * <ref refid="struct_ring_map_1_1var_a5a86595b55297fc11526c71a6e828ff4_1a5a86595b55297fc11526c71a6e828ff4" kindref="member">bigelem</ref></computeroutput>. Three independent <computeroutput>is_one</computeroutput> flags let the evaluator skip whichever factors are trivially 1, and <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_ring_map_1_1var_a75b1fb95158d8c5bad8637d20072200c_1a75b1fb95158d8c5bad8637d20072200c" kindref="member">is_zero</ref></computeroutput> short-circuits the whole multiplication when the variable maps to 0. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
